      "id": "claim_f0b594224b97476fbfd1e6145e421c56",
      "statement": "Each Electron JS bundle (browser, renderer, worker, sandboxed_renderer, isolated_renderer, node, utility, preload_realm) is built by webpack through a small config that calls a shared factory in webpack.config.base.js with a target whose entry is lib/<target>/init.ts.",
