      "id": "claim_3b8b58b885f4417993f717faa7f5d230",
      "statement": "Targets that delete Node globals (renderer, worker) route Buffer, global and process through lib/common/webpack-provider, while targets without Node (sandboxed_renderer, isolated_renderer, preload_realm) get polyfilled Buffer and process.",
